bility to remove skill points during character creationCobwebs can now only be destroyed with fire spellsSwitching between controller and mouse/keyboard is now seamlessFixed a bug that caused the player character to move without any player inputFixed a bug causing mouse sensitivity to default to a very low valueFixed a bug allowing being able to unlock the same spell twice","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T13:24:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155571354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3573120-1830797770232899","game_id":"steam-3573120","kind":"update","title":"SpellChain Demo Patch v1.0.2","summary":"v1.0.2 Patch notes:Reduced health of both bossesEnemy quantity and time to kill adjustedReduced resistances of some enemiesFixed a bug causing the Market not to spawn","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-23T11:38:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770232899","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3573120-1830163047268143","game_id":"steam-3573120","kind":"update","title":"SpellChain Demo Patch v1.0.1","summary":"Thank you to all who've played and provided feedback over the last 24 hours! The following issues/bugs have been addressed and fixed:Replaced AI placeholder icons of Trinkets with human created icons.Improved mouse & gamepad sensitivity control.Fixed a bug where the audio sliders within the main menu weren't working.Other Audio fixes.Cheers!- D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-21T10:27:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047268143","verified_at":"2026-10